{
  "name": "InOut AI - 21 UAE Area Branch Resolver",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "contract-note",
      "name": "Input Output Contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Uae Area Branch Resolver\n\nNormalizes Abu Dhabi area text or coordinates and returns configured service-area and branch routing.\n\nInput: Area text, address, Google Maps link, latitude, or longitude.\nOutput: { status: \"MATCHED|AMBIGUOUS|UNSUPPORTED|UNKNOWN\", normalizedArea: \"\", branchId: \"\", confidence: \"\" }\n\nShared Input Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"correlationId\": \"\",\n  \"messageId\": \"\",\n  \"conversationId\": \"\",\n  \"customerId\": \"\",\n  \"customerPhone\": \"\",\n  \"detectedLanguage\": \"\",\n  \"intent\": \"\",\n  \"payload\": {}\n}\n```\n\nShared Output Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"data\": {},\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"correlationId\": \"\",\n    \"workflow\": \"\",\n    \"durationMs\": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n\nRequired fields:\n- correlationId\n- workflowExecutionId\n- idempotencyKey when writing\n\nRules:\n- Recognize aliases including MBZ, Mohammed Bin Zayed City, مدينة محمد بن زايد, Mussafah, Musaffah, مصفح, Khalifa City, مدينة خليفة, Shakhbout City, مدينة شخبوط, Riyadh City, مدينة الرياض, Al Falah, الفلاح.\n- Do not invent actual coverage, branch ownership, or driver zones.\n- Use configured service areas, service API coverage, and branch data as the source of truth.\n- Return UNKNOWN or AMBIGUOUS when the area cannot be safely routed."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow-input",
      "name": "Workflow Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "normalize-area-name",
      "name": "Normalize Area Name",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -420,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const originalArea = String($json.area || $json.serviceArea || $json.address || $json.query || '').trim();\nconst mapUrl = String($json.googleMapsLink || $json.google_maps_link || $json.locationUrl || '');\nconst normalizeArabic = (value) => String(value || '').replace(/[إأآا]/g, 'ا').replace(/[ة]/g, 'ه').replace(/[ى]/g, 'ي');\nconst normalizedAreaInput = normalizeArabic(originalArea).toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9\\u0600-\\u06FF\\s-]/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim();\nconst aliasTemplates = ['MBZ','Mohammed Bin Zayed City','مدينة محمد بن زايد','Mussafah','Musaffah','مصفح','Khalifa City','مدينة خليفة','Shakhbout City','مدينة شخبوط','Riyadh City','مدينة الرياض','Al Falah','الفلاح'];\nconst coordinateSource = `${mapUrl} ${JSON.stringify($json.coordinates || $json.location || {})}`;\nconst match = coordinateSource.match(/(?:@|q=|ll=|query=)?(-?\\d{1,2}\\.\\d+)\\s*,\\s*(-?\\d{1,3}\\.\\d+)/i);\nconst lat = Number($json.lat ?? $json.latitude ?? $json.coordinates?.lat ?? $json.location?.lat ?? (match ? match[1] : NaN));\nconst lng = Number($json.lng ?? $json.longitude ?? $json.coordinates?.lng ?? $json.location?.lng ?? (match ? match[2] : NaN));\nconst validCoordinates = Number.isFinite(lat) && Number.isFinite(lng) && lat >= 22 && lat <= 27 && lng >= 51 && lng <= 57;\nreturn [{ json: { ...$json, originalArea, normalizedAreaInput, aliasTemplates, mapUrl, coordinates: { lat: validCoordinates ? lat : null, lng: validCoordinates ? lng : null, valid: validCoordinates }, correlationId: $json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id || 'corr_' + Date.now() } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "search-area-aliases",
